  "content": "<h4>此资源包为工具上的附魔光效添加了<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>发光效果</strong>，</span>使其看起来更加鲜艳且时尚。</h4><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-with-hold-my-items-mod.webp\" alt=\"Sinnelar - 附魔光效 Minecraft 资源包展示（配合 Hold My Items 模组）\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-bow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弓箭矢发光动画\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-crossbow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弩箭矢发光动画\" width=\"50%\">\n<br></p><p>此资源包完全适用于&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">原版 Minecraft 1.21.4 - 26.2</span></strong></p><p><strong>附魔工具列表：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>剑</li>\n<li>斧</li>\n<li>镐</li>\n<li>锹</li>\n<li>锄</li>\n<li>长矛</li>\n<li>3D 锤</li>\n<li>弓</li>\n<li>弩</li>\n<li>钓鱼竿</li>\n<li>三叉戟（1.21.4+）</li>\n<li>盾牌（1.21.4+）</li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.21.4 以下版本需安装 CIT Resewn<br></span></strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/ui/b-ct-d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"177\"></span></strong></a></p><p><strong>鸣谢：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>是的，灵感来源于&nbsp;<strong>Actions &amp; Stuff</strong></li>\n</ul><hr><div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3122\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/sinnelar-affiliates/sparked-host-promo-code-2026-minecraft-sinnelar.webp\" alt=\"Sparked Host 促销码 2026 - 使用代码 Sinnelar 可享 Minecraft 服务器托管 25% 折扣\" width=\"100%\">\n  </a>\n</div>",
